message: "If you cite this computational research thesis, please use the metadata below. No DOI is minted here; do not invent one."
type: thesis
title: "Immunometabolic tumour-immune interaction ODEs under explicit non-parameters: lactate, checkpoint proxies, and host constraints that must not enter Theta"
authors:
  - family-names: Ogbonna
    given-names: Kelechi Emeka
    email: kelechiogbonna300@gmail.com
    alias: cloudynirvana
abstract: >-
  Can lactate, checkpoint proxies, and host constraints stay as
  refuse-as-parameter evidence objects that change hypothesis rank without
  entering Theta as kinetic parameters? On a toy tumour-immune-lactate ODE,
  a checkpoint label moves the winning legal structure, and a host lactate
  band can block that move, while Theta stays length 7. An illegal fit that
  adds a lactate-suppression coefficient lowers the residual and is refused
  by the ledger. Not a medical device. Not a dose.
keywords:
  - immunometabolism
  - lactate
  - tumour-immune ODE
  - checkpoint proxy
  - parameter identifiability
  - hypothesis rank
  - refuse-as-parameter
  - computational oncology
  - research-only
